+## -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
+##
+## TheVirtualBrain-Scientific Package. This package holds all simulators, and
+## analysers necessary to run brain-simulations. You can use it stand alone or
+## in conjunction with TheVirtualBrain-Framework Package.
